    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie \nThis robust detached home is located in a quiet cul-de-sac on the southern edge of Carlow town. Constructed in 2006, accommodation extends to 150msq over two floors, delivering generously proportioned 4/5 bedroom configuration with three bathrooms. The residence enjoys all mains services. Space heating is delivered via a gas fired central heating system, while a solid fuel fireplace in the main sitting room offers complimentary options.The home enjoys a host of quality fixtures and fittings; granite worktops in the kitchen area and wall finished bathrooms.Offering a large detached home in an attractive urban setting, viewing of this home are highly recommended and invited on a strictly appointment basis."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHall - 4.37m x 2.05m\nTimber hall door with side glazing. Ceramic tiled floor. Radiator cabinet. Carpeted stairs with open storage beneath. Coving.\n\nLounge - 5.05m x 4.15m\nFeature bay windows to front. Laminate timber floor. Solid fuel fireplace with gas supply. Double french doors to kitchen/ dining area. Coving.\n\nKitchen/ Dining Area - 7.07m x 4.19m\nDouble French doors and window to rear. Curtains and pole. Pelmet and blinds. Marlay flooring. Solid maple floor and wall units. Feature breakfast bar and stools. Granite worktop and part-tiled walls. Recess lighting. Coving\n\nUtility Room - 2.50m x 2.49m\nGlass panelled door to side. Window to rear. Marlay flooring. Wall mounted gas boiler. Plumbing for utility machines.\n\nW.C. - 1.51m x 1.46m\nWindow to side. Toilet and sink. Marlay flooring.\n\nShower Room - 1.53m x 0.87m\nShower cubicle with Triton shower. Marlay flooring.\n\nFamily Room - 4.92m x 2.96m\nLarge window to front. Laminate timber floor.\n\nLanding - 2.19m x 2.09m\nVelux window to rear. Carpets. Hot-press off. Attic access hatch.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.26m x 2.97m\nSingle room with feature bay window to front. Carpets. Built in wardrobe.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.98m x 3.27m\nMaster room. Feature bay window to front. Carpets. Built in wardrobe. En-Suite off.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.15m x 1.00m\nWindow to side. Ceramic tiled floor and walls. Toilet, sink with vanity storage, shower cubicle with T90SR electric shower. Wall, mirror and shaving light.\n\nBathroom - 2.04m x 1.75m\nWindow to side. Toilet, sink and bath. Ceramic tiled walls, Marlay flooring. Aqualisa mains shower and screen above bath.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.99m x 2.45m\nDouble room, window to rear. Carpets and blinds.\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.14m x 3.28m\nDouble room, window to rear. Carpets and blinds. Built in wardrobe.\n\n"
      },
